# Darkn OS: let the user at the local seat create virtual input devices.
# Voice typing (Handy + dotool) needs this to send Ctrl+V after it puts the
# transcribed text on the clipboard. This grants access to /dev/uinput only,
# so it allows sending keystrokes but not reading the real keyboard, which is
# what membership of the "input" group would also allow.
# Must sort before 73-seat-late.rules for the uaccess tag to apply.
KERNEL=="uinput", SUBSYSTEM=="misc", TAG+="uaccess", OPTIONS+="static_node=uinput"
